cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset or code, please cite the paper below."
title: "marrakech-tourism-llm: data and code for a single-inference zero-shot LLM framework for multi-dimensional tourism review analysis"
abstract: >-
  Extracted-signal dataset and analysis code for a framework based on Large
  Language Models that extracts six analytical dimensions from a single
  zero-shot inference, applied to 14,838 TripAdvisor reviews of two heritage
  attractions in Marrakech, Morocco.
type: dataset
